- expenses and payables: (SUPERSEDED for vendor-linked items — see vendor & payments Option A hub below)
    - Non-vendor overhead only (petty cash, no vendor) may remain a slim entry later; vendor-linked accruals live in vendor & payments.

- vendor & payments: Restructure vendor payments (mirror Billing & Invoicing). **Option A hub** — all vendor payables (direct + indirect) in this workspace.

    EXPENSE TYPES:
    - Direct expenses = PO-based vendor bills (VendorInvoice linked to PO(s)). Existing M5 invoice-first flow.
    - Indirect expenses = non-PO accruals against a vendor (salary, stationary, rent, etc.). MARK first (Dr expense category / Cr vendor AP), pay later via vendor payment.

    Dashboard KPIs (filter-scoped: date range default current month, vendor, product):
    - Total Purchases — sum of VendorInvoice billed in period (direct only).
    - Total Outstanding — all open VendorInvoice balance (vendor/product filtered).
    - Awaiting Bills — POs received/eligible but no vendor invoice yet.
    - Total Indirect Expenses — sum of marked indirect expenses in period.
    - Target Payment — unpaid vendor bills + marked indirect expenses due on or before LEAST(today, filter.endDate) (cumulative, like Target Collection).
    - Total Payment — vendor payment vouchers in period (allocations to bills + indirect).

    Tabs (all respect top filters):
    - Awaiting Vendor Bills — eligible POs per vendor (register invoice action).
    - Vendor Bills — outstanding VendorInvoices, default grouped by vendor, multi-select.
    - Indirect Expenses — marked liabilities (Marked / Partially paid / Paid); Add/Mark action.
    - Payments — vendor payment history (direct + indirect allocations).
    - Debit Notes — document-only, not against PO/invoice (mirror customer CN).
    - Vendor Ledger — subsidiary AP statement for selected vendor.
    - Target Payment tab — vendor-wise target vs paid this month (mirror Collection tab).

    Record Payment page (/accounts/vendor-payments/record-payment):
    - Section 1 — Vendor select.
    - Section 2 — Vendor details: Amount Due (bills + indirect), Last Payment Amount.
    - Section 3 — Payment details: Advance (prior vendor advance), Payment Amount, Payment Date, Payment Method, Bank account, Reference No, Notes. (AP sub-ledger implicit from vendor.)
    - Section 4 — Allocation toggle: (a) Vendor Bills FIFO by due date; (b) Indirect Expenses open liabilities FIFO by due date. Advance applicable to either list.
    - Section 5 — Summary: Total Paid, Advance Applied, Sum Allocated (bills + indirect), Balance Due After Payment.

